00:00:00,020 --> 00:00:02,230
(Amy:)This is a portable
electroencephalogram.

2
00:00:02,230 --> 00:00:04,780
(Amy:)I'm doing research
on emotions and brain activity.

3
00:00:04,780 --> 00:00:06,130
(Amy:)So when you start crying,

4
00:00:06,130 --> 00:00:08,470
(Amy:)I can see which region
of the brain is activated.

5
00:00:09,430 --> 00:00:11,570
(Amy:)Then I'm going to stimulate
the analogous area

6
00:00:11,570 --> 00:00:14,400
(Amy:)in the brain of a rhesus monkey
and see if he cries.

7
00:00:15,510 --> 00:00:17,640
(Amy:)Cool, huh?

