00:00:32,320 --> 00:00:34,460
(Howard:)I choose you.

9
00:00:34,460 --> 00:00:36,130
(Leonard:)Really?

10
00:00:36,130 --> 00:00:37,990
(Howard:)Yep. I moved out
of my mother's house.

11
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:39,060
(Howard:)Cord is cut.

12
00:00:39,060 --> 00:00:41,260
(Howard:)I'm all yours.

13
00:00:42,070 --> 00:00:43,620
(Bernadette:)What did she say
when you told her?

14
00:00:43,620 --> 00:00:46,570
(Howard:)I don't know. She hasn't
responded to my email yet.

15
00:00:46,570 --> 00:00:49,310
(Bernadette:)This is so great.

16
00:00:49,310 --> 00:00:51,370
(Bernadette:)I love you, Howard.

17
00:00:51,380 --> 00:00:52,660
(Howard:)I love you, too.

18
00:00:52,660 --> 00:00:54,080
(Howard:)So what's for dinner?

19
00:00:55,780 --> 00:00:57,910
(Bernadette:)Well, I don't really have much
of anything in the house.

20
00:00:57,920 --> 00:00:59,820
(Howard:)That's fine.

